{"name":"Sunrise","hex":"#f4bf77","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Sunrise","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A number of places in the United States:\nA census-designated place in Kenai Peninsula Borough, Alaska.\nA city in Broward County, Florida. \nA neighbourhood of the city of Long Beach, Los Angeles County, California.\nA township and unincorporated community therein, in Chisago County, Minnesota.\nAn unincorporated community in Bath County, Virginia.\nAn unincorporated community in Wood County, West Virginia.\nA ghost town in Platte County, Wyoming.","A census-designated place in Kenai Peninsula Borough, Alaska."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Sunrise"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sunrise","blocks":[{"text":"Sunrise is the moment when the upper rim of the Sun appears on the horizon in the morning, at the start of the Sun path. The term can also refer to the entire process of the solar disk crossing the horizon."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg/330px-Spring_Lake%2C_New_Jersey_Beach_at_Sunrise.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunrise"},{"title":"Sunrise (studio)","blocks":[{"text":"Sunrise  is a Japanese animation studio, serving as the flagship division and the trade name for the IP Production Group unit of Bandai Namco Filmworks, a subsidiary of Bandai Namco Holdings. The division is responsible for the Sunrise label, focusing on animation production. Prior to 2022, Sunrise operated as a separate company with its production offices being under one roof. Sunrise started its operations as a company in September 1972 under the Sunrise Studio name. After its split from Shoeisha and film distributor Tohokushinsha in 1977, it was rebranded to Nippon Sunrise and took its current name in 1987. After 22 years as an independent studio, it was acquired by toy manufacturer Bandai in 1994 before merging with video game publishing company Namco to form Bandai Namco Holdings in 2005."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A8%E3%83%80%E6%9C%AC%E7%A4%BE%EF%BC%885%E9%9A%8E%EF%BC%89.jpg/330px-%E3%83%81%E3%83%A8%E3%83%80%E6%9C%AC%E7%A4%BE%EF%BC%885%E9%9A%8E%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunrise_(studio)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg/500px-Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg/1280px-Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg/500px-Wie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Towers of the Church of the Assumption in Bielany-Kraków over the Wolski Forest just after sunrise.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWie%C5%BCe_ko%C5%9Bcio%C5%82a_na_Bielanach_w_Krakowie_ponad_Lasem_Wolskim%2C_20201122_0729_5085.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Sunrise_In_Lagos%2C_Nigeria_Feb_2023.jpg/500px-Sunrise_In_Lagos%2C_Nigeria_Feb_2023.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1